url: "https://epilepsycenter.github.io/tracer/"
abstract: >-
  TRACER is a desktop application for analysing patch-clamp and field
  recordings. It reads HEKA PatchMaster, Axon ABF, NWB and other formats,
  and provides event detection, action potentials, I-V curves,
  passive properties, field potentials and LTP, burst detection,
  paired recordings, spectral analysis and cohort statistics across
  recordings, with exports to Excel, Prism, ASTERISM and NWB.
keywords:
  - electrophysiology
  - patch clamp
  - field potential
  - neuroscience
  - data analysis
  - NWB
